# ==============================================================================
# SofraPOS — VS Code REST Client Koleksiyonu (requests.http)
# Tüm demo hesapları için varsayılan parola: Sofra2026!
# Önce make reset-demo (simülatörü durdurur), ardından login isteklerini çalıştırın.
# İstekleri başlık sırasıyla tek tek gönderin. Olumsuz testlerin beklenen kodları başlıkta yazılıdır.
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@password = Sofra2026!

### 1. Sağlık ve Altyapı Kontrolleri (GET /health, GET /_hz/cc64, GET /metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/_hz/cc64
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 2. Demo Hesap Listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/demo-accounts
Accept: application/json

### 3. Giriş: Seed Kullanıcısı (seed.ceylan@ddo-case.invalid — Merkez Yönetim)
# @name loginSeed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seed.ceylan@ddo-case.invalid",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 4. Giriş: Garson (waiter)
# @name loginWaiter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "garson@sofrapos.local",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@waiterToken = {{loginWaiter.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 5. Giriş: Kasiyer (cashier)
# @name loginCashier
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kasiyer@sofrapos.local",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@cashierToken = {{loginCashier.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 6. Giriş: Aşçı / Mutfak KDS (chef)
# @name loginChef
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "asci@sofrapos.local",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@chefToken = {{loginChef.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 7. Giriş: Şube Müdürü (branch_manager)
# @name loginManager
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mudur@sofrapos.local",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@managerToken = {{loginManager.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 8. Giriş: Merkez Yönetim (hq_manager)
# @name loginHQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "merkez@sofrapos.local",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@hqToken = {{loginHQ.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 9. Giriş: Müşteri / QR Menü (customer)
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "musteri@sofrapos.local",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 10. Yetki İhlali Testi (Garson rolü Merkez Yönetim raporuna erişemez -> 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/hq
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 11. F-1: Menü, Varyantlar ve Ek Seçenekler (Modifier) Listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 12. F-1: Yeni Menü Ürünü Ekleme (Idempotency-Key ile)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/menu/items
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: rest-client-menu-item-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "code": "MN-GAVURDAGI",
  "name": "Cevizli Gavurdağı Salatası",
  "description": "Nar ekşili ve bol cevizli taze salata",
  "base_price_kurus": 12500,
  "station": "cold",
  "course": 1,
  "prep_time_sec": 150
}

### 13. F-2: Şube Masalarını Listeleme
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tables?branch_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 14. F-2 & T-1: Masa Açma (Adisyon Oluşturma)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Idempotency-Key: rest-client-open-table-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": 1,
  "table_id": 1
}

@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}

### 15. F-2 & T-4: Adisyona Varyantlı ve Modifier'lı Kalem Ekleme (İskender 1.5 Porsiyon + Ekstra Tereyağı)
# @name addIskender
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menu_item_id": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "variant_id": 2,
  "modifier_ids": [1]
}

### 16. T-5: Kampanya Tetiklemek İçin 3 Adet Lahmacun Ekleme
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menu_item_id": 2,
  "quantity": 3,
  "variant_id": 4
}

### 17. T-1: Adisyon Olay Günlüğünden Yeniden Hesaplama Kanıtı (Rebuild)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/rebuild
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 18. F-6 & T-5: Kampanya ve Kupon Motoru (En Avantajlı Kombinasyon Seçimi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/apply-campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coupon_code": "SOFRA50"
}

### 19. F-3 & T-3: Mutfak Ekranı (KDS) Aktif Siparişler
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kds/items?branch_id=1&station=all
Authorization: Bearer {{chefToken}}

### 20. T-3: KDS SSE Kopma Sonrası Kaçırılan Olayları Geri Alma (Event Replay)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kds/events?branch_id=1&since_event_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{chefToken}}

### 21. F-4 & T-2: Hesap Bölüşme Önizlemesi (3 Kişilik Eşit Bölüşme — Kuruş Kaymasız)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/split-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "split_mode": "EQUAL",
  "parts": 3
}

### 22. F-4 & T-2: Karışık Ödeme (Nakit + Kart) ve Bahşiş
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Idempotency-Key: rest-client-payment-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "MIXED",
  "split_mode": "MIXED",
  "cash_amount_kurus": 15000,
  "card_amount_kurus": 20000,
  "tip_kurus": 2500
}

### 23. F-5 & T-4: Stok, Alt Reçete (Yarı Mamul) ve Hareketler
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory?branch_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 24. F-5 & T-4: Gün Sonu Fiziksel Stok Sayımı ve Fark (Variance) Raporu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/count
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": 1,
  "counts": [
    { "ingredient_code": "ING-BEEF", "counted_grams": 48500 },
    { "ingredient_code": "ING-TOMATO", "counted_grams": 49100 }
  ]
}

### 25. F-7 & T-2: Şube Z Raporu (Nakit + Kart = Toplam Mutabakatı)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/z-report?branch_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 26. F-7: 8 Şube Merkez Yönetim Raporu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/hq
Authorization: Bearer {{hqToken}}

### 27. Ortak Gereksinim: Append-Only Denetim Kayıtları (Keyset Sayfalama)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit-logs?after_id=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{hqToken}}

### 29. Refresh token ile oturum yenile (loginWaiter önce çalışmalı)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{loginWaiter.response.body.$.refresh_token}}"}

### 30. Aktif kullanıcı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 31. Şubeler
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/branches

### 32. Keyset sayfalı adisyonlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?branch_id=1&after_id=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 33. Adisyon ayrıntısı (reset isteğinden önce çalıştırın)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 34. Kampanyalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}

### 35. KDS canlı SSE (isteği iptal edip Last-Event-ID ile tekrar bağlanabilirsiniz)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kds/stream?branch_id=1&since_event_id=0
Authorization: Bearer {{chefToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream
Last-Event-ID: 0

### 36. KDS PENDING -> PREPARING (addIskender önce çalışmalı)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kds/items/{{addIskender.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{chefToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"PREPARING"}

### 37. KDS PREPARING -> READY
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kds/items/{{addIskender.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{chefToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"READY"}

### 38. KDS READY -> SERVED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kds/items/{{addIskender.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{chefToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"SERVED"}

### 39. Son sayım farkı raporu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/variance-report?branch_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 40. Vardiya kapat (0 fiziksel kasa geçerlidir; ödemelerden sonra deneyin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shifts/close
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"branch_id":1,"closing_cash_kurus":0}

### 41. Yeni vardiya aç (kapama isteğinden sonra; ikinci kez 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shifts/open
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"branch_id":1,"opening_cash_kurus":500000}

### 42. Bağımsız taşıma / birleştirme / iptal senaryosu: kaynak masa
# @name sourceOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"branch_id":1,"table_id":3}

### 43. Kaynağa kalem ekle
# @name sourceItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{sourceOrder.response.body.$.id}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"menu_item_id":4,"quantity":1}

### 44. İptal ve tam stok iadesi (üretilmiş kalemde produce_waste:true gönderin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{sourceOrder.response.body.$.id}}/items/{{sourceItem.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Müşteri vazgeçti","produce_waste":false}

### 45. Kaynağı boş T-04 masasına taşı
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{sourceOrder.response.body.$.id}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"target_table_id":4}

### 46. Hedef masa aç
# @name targetOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"branch_id":1,"table_id":5}

### 47. İki ödenmemiş adisyonu birleştir (kaynak MERGED olur)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"source_order_id":{{sourceOrder.response.body.$.id}},"target_order_id":{{targetOrder.response.body.$.id}}}

### 48. Başka şube erişimi engellenmeli: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tables?branch_id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 49. Yanlış parola: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"garson@sofrapos.local","password":"yanlis"}

### 50. Yetkisiz reset: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reset-demo
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 51. OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json

### 52. OpenAPI YAML
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.yaml

### 53. Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### 54. Demo Verisini İlk Seed Haline Sıfırlama (make reset-demo)
# DİKKAT: Mevcut işlem verilerini temizler. Son adım olarak çalıştırın.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reset-demo
Authorization: Bearer {{hqToken}}

### 55. Yetkili veritabanı tanılaması
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/db/check
Authorization: Bearer {{hqToken}}

### 56. Servis bilgisi
GET {{baseUrl}}/
